# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Fan-Shun Meng et al. (2025). A Neural Network Interatomic Potential for the Ternary α-Fe-C-H System: Toward Million-Atom Simulations of Hydrogen Embrittlement in Steel.
#   JOM. doi:10.1007/s11837-025-07721-4
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 4e906fbf076dda40...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 535 (Application/model instance). Method identity follows
