# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/meng2025ternary.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the Behler-Parrinello NNIP (n2p2; 24 radial and 120
# angular symmetry functions per element) for alpha-Fe, cementite and C/H
# in pristine and defective iron, trained on 62,743 spin-polarized VASP
# configurations (90/10 split); the training and test RMSEs. Defect,
# dislocation, interface and tensile results are properties.

